  "details": "Having to check a second large box is slowing the creation process significantly.  Having a check box that you check with the \"I agree\" checkbox would be helpful.  This box should be a saved parameter that stays checked when checked the first time.\n\nYes, the avatar is subject to change when it is re-uploaded, but it should be assumed that every time a change is made that the creator owns the copyright agreement.  Therefore, it is irrelevant to have to re-check a box over and over and over again.\n\nI hope that this can be fixed soon.  Me and a lot of other creators would appreciate it.",
